# ============================================================================
# accidental shell-redirect artefacts
# ============================================================================
# Type annotations occasionally land on disk as files when a `->` in a pasted
# command is read as a redirect. They are mistakes, not artefacts to keep, so
# delete them rather than relying on this rule -- it is a safety net only.
/str
/int
/bool
/float
/Path
/List*
/Dict*
/Optional*
/Set*
/Tuple*


scripts/